      "text": "Full patriotism on display! On #IndependenceDay2025, 97 people became #NewUSCitizens--including 2 #ServiceMembers--at the home of President Washington @MountVernon. They came from 94 countries and stood united as @DepSec_Edgar led the Oath of Allegiance where each promised to support and defend the Constitution and laws of the United States. Governor @Schwarzenegger warmly welcomed them saying nothing is impossible in America and reminding them of the limitless opportunity in our country. Many congratulations to our new Americans!",
