      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "We vet and screen all applications, including those of U.S. citizens when they petition for a family member. When this citizen petitioned for his alien wife, his background check came back with many red flags. It turns out he had DOZENS of active arrest warrants from four police departments in Ark.! The warrants were for:\n▪️Two thefts\n▪️Two DUIs\n▪️Driving on a suspended license\n▪️Child neglect\n▪️25 charges of failure to appear\n▪️16 criminal contempt of court charges\n@FortSmithPD arrested him when he came with his spouse to our Fort Smith Ark. office for her Green Card interview. He will now face justice. Our duty to make America safe again goes beyond uncovering criminal aliens trying to access the immigration system.",
