      "quoted_tweet_id": null,
      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "We put Americans first by removing illegal aliens who pose a threat to our communities. When a criminal alien came to our Tampa asylum office, our robust vetting showed that he had multiple pending felony criminal charges for:\n\nSoliciting to Commit Human Trafficking for Commercial Sexual Activity (victim under 18)\n\nLewd Lascivious Battery\n\nTraveling to Meet a Minor After Using Computer\n\nUse of Computer Services or Devices to Solicit\n\nUnlawful Use of Two-Way Communications Device\n\n@ICEgov took him away in handcuffs. If you think you can commit these kinds of crimes and stay in America, think again. @POTUS and @Sec_Noem are removing predators like this every day!",
      "text_resolved": "We put Americans first by removing illegal aliens who pose a threat to our communities. When a criminal alien came to our Tampa asylum office, our robust vetting showed that he had multiple pending felony criminal charges for:\n\nSoliciting to Commit Human Trafficking for Commercial Sexual Activity (victim under 18)\n\nLewd Lascivious Battery\n\nTraveling to Meet a Minor After Using Computer\n\nUse of Computer Services or Devices to Solicit\n\nUnlawful Use of Two-Way Communications Device\n\n@ICEgov took him away in handcuffs. If you think you can commit these kinds of crimes and stay in America, think again. @POTUS and @Sec_Noem are removing predators like this every day!",
